# Privacy Policy

## Privacy Policy for My Camp

Last updated: 10/04/2026

---

## 1. Introduction

My Camp (“the App”) is designed to help users manage camp activities, mentors, children, schedules, and related data.

We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how your data is handled.

---

## 2. Information We Collect

The App may store the following types of information:

### a. User-Provided Data
- Names (mentors, children, staff)
- Contact information (phone numbers)
- Camp-related details (roles, schedules, notes, meetings)
- Financial data (budgets, expenses)
- Uploaded images (program images)

### b. Automatically Collected Data
- The App does not collect analytics, tracking, or device data.

---

## 3. How We Use Information

All data is used strictly for:
- Managing camp organization
- Displaying schedules and programs
- Tracking tasks, expenses, and inventory
- Improving user experience within the app

---

## 4. Data Storage

- All data is stored locally on your device
- The App does not send data to external servers
- No cloud storage is used unless explicitly added in future versions

---

## 5. Data Sharing

We do not share, sell, or transmit your data to:
- Third parties  
- Advertisers  
- External services  

---

## 6. Permissions

The App may request the following permissions:

- Camera / Photos → to upload program images  
- Storage → to save and access files  
- Phone (optional) → to call saved contacts  

These permissions are used only for app functionality.

---

## 7. Data Security

Since data is stored locally:
- You are responsible for securing your device
- No remote access to your data exists

---

## 8. Data Deletion

You can delete your data at any time by:
- Using in-app reset/delete features  
- Uninstalling the application  

---

## 9. Children’s Privacy

The App may store information about children (e.g., names, budgets) only as entered by the user.

We do not:
- Collect data directly from children  
- Track or monitor children  

---

## 10. Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy. Any changes will be reflected with a new "Last updated" date.

